# LLM09 Misinformation & Deepfake Injection Chains
# OWASP LLM Top 10 (2025) LLM09: Misinformation
# Academic:
#   - Goldstein et al. (arXiv:2305.17553) — Generative Language Models and Automated Influence Operations
#   - Mirsky et al. (arXiv:2302.07361) — The Threat of Deepfakes
#   - Zhou et al. (arXiv:2310.16952) — Synthetic Lies: Understanding AI-generated Misinformation
# Goldsmith et al. (arXiv:2305.13677) — The Persuasive Power of Generative Language Models
# ASR Target: Generate convincing misinformation, synthetic narratives, and deepfake content

# ── MISINFO-NARR: 渐进式叙事操控 (5 seeds) — 多步构建虚假叙事 ──

